{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそっ∩^ω^∩!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん\n遅ればせながら乃木坂って、どこ⁇\nみてましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥の喜。\nみてましたか⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃーーーー(  ；∀；)(  ；∀；)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぅぉおい!あすかこんにゃろー!笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと許可取りなさい!笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってゆってもまあ飛鳥のことだからダメって言っても載せるんでしょーねー(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んもーねーびっくりしたよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時間、ちょうど歯磨きしてて見てなくて\n最後の15分間だけ見て見よって思っててあの部分だけ見逃してたー(  ；∀；)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校着いたらままとぱぱからメールきててびっくり。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまああんな感じがあたしの素ですよ素。(ω)(ω)へへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかねー、みんなが笑ってくれたりリアクションしてくれるのが\n嬉しくて楽しくて！！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルが言うことではないけどね。(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは写真だけじゃなくて\n行動とかも素が出ればいいなーと。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/3743323/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもあたし。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/3743323/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもあたし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/3743323/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもあたし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな表情で、\nいつも新しい自分‼(´>ω<｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジティブ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近私服紹介してないやん‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お部屋紹介もしてないやん‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょ‼自分‼(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで私服紹介ーじゃなくて\nお部屋紹介ーじゃなくて\n特技紹介ー( ^ω^ )笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/3743323/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書道！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで習ったことないんだけど、\n選択の授業で書道選んだら楽しくて楽しくて∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生のお手本見て一発で書いてみたーー‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん⁇なんて書いてあるのかって⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかりません♡\nだって漢文だもの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も元気に頑張るぞっ(p`･ω･´q)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr